#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Root-only v6.3.7 installer with descriptor-pinned source staging.

The source release must be the direct canonical child of
/opt/tak-ili-inache/releases.  Every component is opened with O_NOFOLLOW and
verified from its descriptor.  Each allowlisted file is copied from its opened
descriptor, then re-opened by name and checked for identical identity/metadata.
"""
